{"id":"n29602-1-3","stage":1,"title":"셋 · 三","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29602-1-3-1","ko":"목적지에 어떻게 갈까?","zh":"去目的地要怎么走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목적지에","meaning":"目的地","explanation":"목적지：目的地；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목적지","audio":"/audio/4e02e650e4bcbdcaabd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55887","senseId":"1","lemma":"목적지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈까?","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e02e650e4bcbdca","term":"목적지","zh":"目的地","audio":"/audio/4e02e650e4bcbdcaabd1.mp3","entryId":"55887","definition":"想要去的地方。","pronunciation":["목쩍찌"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cb52f7efad8ed17ce543.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29602-1-3-2","ko":"인원이 많으니 셋으로 나눈 후 차 세 대로 가자.","zh":"人数太多，我们分成三组，各开一辆车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"인원이","meaning":"人员","explanation":"인원：人员；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인원","audio":"/audio/4db37806d287be242e3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70773","senseId":"1","lemma":"인원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많으니","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"셋으로","meaning":"三","explanation":"셋：三；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"셋","audio":"/audio/28ed1f7d8986d21d30a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29602","senseId":"1","lemma":"셋","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나눈","meaning":"分为，分成","explanation":"나누다：分为，分成；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"1","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대로","meaning":"辆，架，台","explanation":"대：辆，架，台；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40639","senseId":"1","lemma":"대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4db37806d287be24","term":"인원","zh":"人员","audio":"/audio/4db37806d287be242e3e.mp3","entryId":"70773","definition":"组成聚会或团体的人；或指那些人的人数。","pronunciation":["이눤"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"28ed1f7d8986d21d","term":"셋","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/28ed1f7d8986d21d30a5.mp3","entryId":"29602","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["섿ː"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"分为，分成","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"使原来的一个整体变成两个以上的部分或碎块。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"084a4bd8972f8d49","term":"후","zh":"后，以后，之后","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3","entryId":"62885","definition":"一定时间过去以后。","pronunciation":["후ː"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"364d448a22b1512f","term":"대","zh":"辆，架，台","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3","entryId":"40639","definition":"计算车辆、飞机、乐器、机械等的计量单位。","pronunciation":["대"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbef14b659d8e30ca659.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29602","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.4003,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去目的地要怎么走呢？","人数太多，我们分成三组，各开一辆车吧。","我觉得这个游戏玩得越多，就越有趣。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去目的地要怎么走呢？","人数太多，我们分成三组，各开一辆车吧。","我觉得这个游戏玩得越多，就越有趣。"],"answer":1}]}
